// title: External Attack Surface Monitoring KQL
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceNetworkEvents, ExposureGraphNodes
// purpose: External Attack Surface Monitoring KQL
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/External%20Attack%20Surface%20Monitoring%20KQL.kql
// kind: repo
